Backport Lichii's recent graphics-pipeline eviction changes to Fritchii v5.8/v5.8.4.

Sources (Zortos, with capy-ai[bot]):
https://github.com/zortos293/Lichii/commit/e63d0a04dfa93a40c185fa16a1be69a134121ea9 (#1334)
https://github.com/zortos293/Lichii/commit/be24147966d78ab680bd873242289e3c70570e3e (#1337)

Adapted to Fritchii's legacy cache loader, pipeline libraries, mesh emulation,
precompiled shader preparation and async translation. Keeps the existing
EDEN_NX2_PIPELINE_EVICT_ABOVE and EDEN_NX2_PRELOAD_ALL_PIPELINES overrides.
The pointer preservation fix from Lichii #1143 is already in these releases.

